$DIR/test.p:3:11: packed literal elements must be field: value
    A packed literal must name each field it sets, as field: value. The fields
    of a packed type have no order a literal could follow, since reserved bits
    sit between them.
    (see "packed types" in the Plutonium spec, section 7.14)
    (run "pluto explain E2105" for a longer explanation)
